# Corpus, scenarios and queries are regenerated deterministically from the seed and the generator
# version, so the bytes do not belong in git — but the manifest does. Its hashes are the frozen
# artifact: `saasbench.test.ts` regenerates from the seed and asserts they still match, so an
# accidental change to generation fails the build instead of silently redefining the benchmark.
*/documents.jsonl
*/scenarios.json
*/queries.json
